What is Water Hardness Removal?

Water Hardness Removal is a process aimed at eliminating calcium, magnesium, and other metal cations from hard water. This treatment is essential as it prevents scale accumulation in plumbing and on appliances, thereby enhancing soap efficacy and substantially prolonging the service life of water-dependent equipment.

